title: Palo Alto Networks: GlobalProtect gateways\nagents: paloalto_api\ncatalog: hw/network/paloalto\nlicense: GPLv2\ndistribution: checkmk-paloalto-api\ndescription:
 Shows the number of users connected to each GlobalProtect gateway ("show
 global-protect-gateway statistics") with optional upper and lower levels. If
 more than one gateway exists an additional "Total" service is created. No
 services are created on firewalls without GlobalProtect gateways.

item:
 The gateway name, or "Total".

discovery:
 One service per gateway, plus "Total" if there is more than one gateway.
